:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="15" name="Text Placeholder 14"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{2C8C2871-0161-4EE9-C47C-A79024B94F11}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph sz="quarter" idx="23"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="576263" y="1435100"/><a:ext cx="3435350" cy="3646576"/></a:xfrm></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1800"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="75000"/></a:schemeClr></a:solidFill></a:rPr><a:t>Purpose</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1400"/><a:t>The purpose of this document is to provide an overview and definition of the Frontier Accelerate for Copilot Program and details on the post-sales engagement:</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1800"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="75000"/></a:schemeClr></a:solidFill></a:rPr><a:t>Agent Solution Deployment Accelerator</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1400"/><a:t>This delivery guide outlines a flexible engagement model. For each step, the guide provides a delivery structure, engagement delivery examples, and discusses necessary activities, assets and resources you may need to familiarize yourself for this engagement. </a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="19" name="Text Placeholder 18"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{7BF55526-4E55-4B6B-BFD4-661A7C614CD3}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph sz="quarter" idx="24"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="4367213" y="1435100"/><a:ext cx="3435350" cy="4719754"/></a:xfrm></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1800" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="75000"/></a:schemeClr></a:solidFill></a:rPr><a:t>Audience</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1400" dirty="0"/><a:t>This document is intended to be used by partner sellers, practice leads, project managers, field consultants, and other partner resources with competencies in Microsoft 365 Copilot, Copilot Studio, Microsoft Foundry, Agent 365, Agent SDK and/or Microsoft Power Platform.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1800" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="75000"/></a:schemeClr></a:solidFill></a:rPr><a:t>Assumptions</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1400" dirty="0"/><a:t>Partner resources involved in the delivery of these engagements have read and understand the content of this delivery guide.  </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1400" dirty="0"/><a:t>Partner understands that this document is not intended to be shared directly with customers.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1800" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="3" name="Content Placeholder 2"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{902B10C6-B280-B611-8673-31D7D0BED58B}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph sz="quarter" idx="25"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="8158163" y="1435100"/><a:ext cx="3436937" cy="1082284"/></a:xfrm></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1800"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="75000"/></a:schemeClr></a:solidFill></a:rPr><a:t>Other notes</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1400"/><a:t>If you believe you have found an error or have a suggestio